index.json: the `versions` entry of Flex's two default endpoints
(https://raw.githubusercontent.com/symfony/recipes/flex/main/index.json,
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/symfony/recipes-contrib/flex/main/index.json),
merged first endpoint wins (`Downloader::initialize`), captured on
2026-09-20 from a Composer cache. Only the key
Flex's `PackageFilter` reads; no `recipes` (so a Flex-enabled Composer
applies none), no `aliases`. Served to both tools by the harnesses through
`extra.symfony.endpoint: ["file://<path>/index.json"]`.

index-recipes.json: the same `versions`, plus the REAL `recipes` entries of
symfony/flex, symfony/console and symfony/framework-bundle (captured from
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/symfony/recipes/flex/main/index.json on
2026-09-23) and nothing else — enough for a harness to exercise both
directions of `Downloader::getRecipes`' version selection without carrying
the 255-package map. `_links` is kept as captured (Flex reads it the moment a recipe matches),
but no harness case lets a recipe match on the Composer side, so no recipe
is ever downloaded. `recipe-conflicts` is deliberately absent: vivacity
ignores it (it only ever removes entries, so ignoring it can only cause a
needless hand-over), and a harness that fed it would not tell the two
apart.
